---
// Women's Wellness IOP, "We understand the load women carry". Sage: the load as a cairn of stacked stones.
// Simplified 2026-11-18 (user: graphics too busy): few big elements, large icon circles, little text, in the style
// of conditions/OcdGraphic.astro and the DBT wheel. Facts are in the bullets beside it. Styles: programs.css (.gx-*).
const load = ["Health", "Relationships", "Caregiving", "Parenting", "Work"];
---
<figure class="gx t-sage" aria-label="Work, parenting, caregiving, relationships and health concerns stack up. The Women's Wellness IOP is an 8 to 12 week space to pause, process and heal.">
  <p class="gx-h">“Holding it all together”</p>
  <ul class="ld-cairn">{load.map((t, k) => <li class={`s${k}`}>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  <figcaption class="gx-cap">8–12 weeks to pause, process &amp; heal</figcaption>
</figure>
